    "detailed_description": "Romance is Dead is a puzzle-solving dating sim, where you play as the overworked Grim Reaper. You find yourself in Limbo with several goth cuties you need to reap, but your one and only scythe has broken! Solve puzzles to explore the depths of Limbo, find treasures lost to time, fix your scythe, and date hot goths!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRomance is Dead is currently in development!  Follow us on Twitter or join us on Discord for regular updates!",
    "about_the_game": "Romance is Dead is a puzzle-solving dating sim, where you play as the overworked Grim Reaper. You find yourself in Limbo with several goth cuties you need to reap, but your one and only scythe has broken! Solve puzzles to explore the depths of Limbo, find treasures lost to time, fix your scythe, and date hot goths!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRomance is Dead is currently in development!  Follow us on Twitter or join us on Discord for regular updates!",
    "short_description": "A Grim Reaper's job is never done. So when your scythe suddenly breaks, you have to venture to the center of Limbo to forge a new one! Fortunately, you have the souls of some HOT GOTHS to accompany you. Solve puzzles, flirt with goth cuties, find lost treasures, and survive deadly hamster attacks!",
